          <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Both are legendary free astrophotography tools, but they approach calibration math, color science, and file organization very differently. Here is an objective comparison to help you choose the right stacking pipeline for your gear.
          </p>
